          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation of a bright point moving in a straight line and then in a zigzag pattern across the sky: probable observation of a satellite.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "28865298cba976ee446f7ba5978f604e6c111791e85cd749a3b98a7e5de06b85"
